<title>UK: TELKOM AT $28.6 IN LONDON.</title>
<headline>TELKOM AT $28.6 IN LONDON.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at $28.6 in London on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of $28.325 and the day's high of $28.625.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Monday as $28.125.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
